Output demo.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 950
Set Height 600
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 24
Set TypingSpeed 60ms

Sleep 1s

Type "sslx grade github.com"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 4s

Type "sslx expiry google.com github.com cloudflare.com"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 4s

Type "sslx inspect /tmp/demo-certs/cert.pem"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 4s

Sleep 2s
